---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../../../components/Hero.astro';
import Cta from '../../../components/Cta.astro';
import SectionNav from '../../../components/SectionNav.astro';
---
<Base title={"When to Stop Extending a Problem Hotel Loan"} description={"What an extension costs a community bank that does not show in the rate, when it makes sense, and five questions to ask before the next one."}>
  <Hero eyebrow="For community banks" title={"When to stop extending."} lead={"An extension keeps the customer and defers the loss. What it costs that does not show in the rate, and five questions to ask before the next one."} />
  <SectionNav section="communityBanks" />
  <main id="main">
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Two sides</p><h2>An extension is right for some loans, and wrong for others.</h2></div>
      <div class="cells two">
        <div><h3>It tends to make sense when</h3><ul><li>The hotel is viable and the owner is capable and cooperative</li><li>The flag is in good standing and any improvement plan is funded</li><li>The hotel is recovering, and the T-12 shows it</li><li>The extension buys a specific thing: a refinance, a sale, a completed renovation</li></ul></div>
        <div><h3>It tends to stop making sense when</h3><ul><li>The loan has already been extended and nothing has improved</li><li>The improvement plan is unfunded and the flag is at risk</li><li>The appraisal is well below the principal balance</li><li>A refinance will not cover the balance, and no one has a date</li><li>The guarantor is tired, or the hotel is losing staff and bookings</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section alt"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">What it costs</p><h2>What an extension costs that does not show in the rate.</h2></div>
      <div class="cells">
        <div><h3>Capital and staff attention</h3><p>The loan stays classified and keeps taking up capital and special assets time.</p></div>
        <div><h3>A later decision, on worse facts</h3><p>If the hotel does not recover, the same decision returns, with an older property and a less patient brand.</p></div>
        <div><h3>The value of waiting</h3><p>A hotel is an operating business. Its value rests on the flag, the staff, the bookings, and the licenses, and it can fall while the bank waits.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section"><div class="wrap intro">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Before the next one</p><h2>Five questions.</h2></div>
      <dl class="pillars">
        <div><dt>1. What exactly does the extension buy?</dt><dd>A refinance, a sale, or a finished renovation, with a date. If it buys time and nothing else, say so.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>2. What has changed since the last one?</dt><dd>If the answer is nothing, the next extension is the same decision again.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>3. What does the flag say?</dt><dd>A notice, an overdue improvement plan, or a failed inspection changes the value of everything else.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>4. What is the recovery if it fails?</dt><dd>Estimate it net of costs, in the committee's comparison, so the downside is on paper.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>5. What would a loan sale give the bank today?</dt><dd>An indicative price, with its assumptions, carries no obligation to sell. It is a number to hold against the extension.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div></section>

    <section class="section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Related reading</p></div><ul class="toc"><li><a href="/library/choices/">Extend, sell, or foreclose <span>Library</span></a></li><li><a href="/banks/community-banks/board-package/">The memo to the loan committee <span>Community banks</span></a></li><li><a href="/glossary/#extension">Extension <span>Glossary</span></a></li><li><a href="/glossary/#loan-modification">Loan modification <span>Glossary</span></a></li></ul></div></section>
  </main>
  <Cta title={"Discuss a hotel loan in confidence."} text={"A conversation and an indicative price carry no obligation to sell."} label={"Start a conversation"} />
</Base>
